---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About — Daniel Vega" description="The story behind the books — calm, honest writing about anxiety for teens.">
  <section class="ab-intro">
    <div class="container ab-intro-inner">
      <div class="ab-portrait-col">
        <span class="ab-portrait-sticker">&#9749;</span>
        <div class="ab-portrait" id="heroAvatar">
          <img src="/image/DanielVega.webp" alt="Daniel Vega" />
        </div>
        <div class="ab-bubble"><span class="ab-wave">&#128075;</span> Glad you're here</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-intro-text">
        <span class="ab-eyebrow">About Daniel</span>
        <h1>I wrote the books I needed at fifteen.</h1>
        <p>Hi — I'm Daniel. I write short, honest books about anxiety for teenagers, because I spent most of mine convinced something was deeply wrong with me.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ab-story">
    <div class="container ab-story-inner">
      <p class="reveal">I was the kid with the racing heart before every class, the one rehearsing how to say "here" during attendance. From the outside I looked fine. Inside, my brain ran worst-case scenarios on a loop, and I was certain everyone could tell.</p>
      <p class="reveal">It took me years — and a lot of help — to learn that anxiety isn't a character flaw or something to "snap out of." It's a feeling to understand, work with, and slowly turn the volume down on.</p>

      <blockquote class="ab-quote reveal">"Nobody handed me the plain, honest version when I needed it. So I wrote it."</blockquote>

      <p class="reveal">So that's what these books are: the plain, honest version. No lectures, no toxic positivity, no promising that one deep breath fixes everything. Just the tools, the stories, and the company I wish I'd had back then — written to actually be finished, even on a low-focus day.</p>
      <p class="reveal">When I'm not writing, I'm usually over-caffeinated, re-reading the same comfort books, and reminding myself to take my own advice.</p>

      <div class="ab-cta reveal">
        <span>Not sure where to start?</span>
        <a href="/books/" class="ab-cta-link">Start with the books <span class="ar">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ab-intro { padding: 50px 0 34px; }
  .ab-intro-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 56px; }
  .ab-portrait-col { flex: 0 0 auto; position: relative; }
  .ab-portrait {
    width: 280px; height: 280px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bg-peach); overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(80,60,40,.14); animation: breathe 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    transition: box-shadow .3s ease;
  }
  .ab-portrait img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 18%; display: block; }
  .ab-portrait-col:hover .ab-portrait { box-shadow: 0 26px 50px rgba(80,60,40,.22); }

  .ab-portrait-sticker {
    position: absolute; bottom: 8px; left: -16px; z-index: 3; font-size: 30px;
    transform: scale(0) rotate(-20deg); opacity: 0;
    transition: transform .35s cubic-bezier(.34,1.7,.5,1), opacity .25s ease; pointer-events: none;
  }
  .ab-portrait-col:hover .ab-portrait-sticker { transform: scale(1) rotate(8deg); opacity: 1; }

  .ab-bubble {
    position: absolute; top: 16px; right: -22px;
    background: var(--badge); color: var(--badge-ink); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;
    padding: 9px 15px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(80,60,40,.16);
    transform: scale(0); opacity: 0; animation: bubble-in .5s .4s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) forwards;
  }
  .ab-wave { display: inline-block; transform-origin: 70% 70%; animation: wave 2.6s ease-in-out infinite; }

  .ab-intro-text { flex: 1; }
  .ab-eyebrow { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .6px; }
  .ab-intro-text h1 { font-size: 38px; margin: 12px 0 16px; max-width: 480px; }
  .ab-intro-text p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0; max-width: 480px; }

  .ab-story { padding: 30px 0 90px; }
  .ab-story-inner { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .ab-story-inner p { font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .ab-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 25px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--accent);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--badge); padding-left: 24px; margin: 34px 0; font-style: italic;
  }

  .ab-cta {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px;
    background: var(--bg-peach); border-radius: 18px; padding: 24px 30px; margin-top: 40px;
  }
  .ab-cta span { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .ab-cta-link { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
  .ab-cta-link .ar { transition: transform .2s ease; }
  .ab-cta-link:hover .ar { transform: translateX(5px); }

  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(26px); transition: opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease; }
  .reveal.revealed { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

  @keyframes breathe { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); } 50% { transform: scale(1.035); } }
  @keyframes wave { 0%, 65%, 100% { transform: rotate(0deg); } 10% { transform: rotate(14deg); } 20% { transform: rotate(-8deg); } 30% { transform: rotate(14deg); } 40% { transform: rotate(-4deg); } 50% { transform: rotate(10deg); } }
  @keyframes bubble-in { to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; } }

  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .ab-intro-inner { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; gap: 30px; }
    .ab-intro-text h1, .ab-intro-text p { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .ab-portrait { width: 220px; height: 220px; }
    .ab-bubble { right: -6px; top: 6px; font-size: 13px; padding: 8px 13px; }
    .ab-cta { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  const items = document.querySelectorAll(".reveal");
  if ("IntersectionObserver" in window) {
    const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach((e) => { if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add("revealed"); io.unobserve(e.target); } });
    }, { threshold: 0.12 });
    items.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));
  } else { items.forEach((el) => el.classList.add("revealed")); }
</script>

